{"title":"Shagbark Stone Hearth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Carpentry Lv 63)</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Carpentry at level 63 <span class=\"muted\">(1719 XP)</span> from 6× <a href=\"#/item/shagbark-plank\">Shagbark Plank</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-fittings\">Titanium Fittings</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/carpentry\">Carpentry</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/stone-hearth\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/f327902d1175987b5d9e.svg\" alt=\"\">Stone Hearth</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/oak-stone-hearth\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/26dcdf2b38b4f6fa44bf.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Stone Hearth</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-stone-hearth\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/6d9cc22ffb75ab5b69ca.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Stone Hearth</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-plank\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/1b65c3eee556804df063.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Plank</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/426de6742aa28902e4da.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Fittings</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/1e68c54a624e2153c1e3.svg\" alt=\"Shagbark Stone Hearth\"></div><h3>Shagbark Stone Hearth</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Carpentry 63</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}